# Carbon Mapper data are non-commercial and not for redistribution: only the README and
# pull manifests are tracked (datasets/carbonmapper/README.md)
datasets/carbonmapper/*
!datasets/carbonmapper/README.md
!datasets/carbonmapper/pulls/
